  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "shannon.cox@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Stryker Corporation&nbsp;(NYSE:SYK) announced that&nbsp;Sherilyn (Sheri) S. McCoyand&nbsp;Rajeev Suri&nbsp;have been nominated for election to the Company's Board of Directors at Stryker's 2018 Annual Meeting of Shareholders, which is expected to be held on&nbsp;May 2, 2018.&nbsp; Their successful elections would bring the total size of the Company's Board to ten members.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2018/Stryker-announces-nomination-of-two-new-Directors-Sheri-S-McCoy-and-Rajeev-Suri/default.aspx\">Read the full release here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Mar 11 2019 18:23:28 GMT+0000",
